& [IR2BoundedImplementationActivationBoundaryV1] is the IR2-IA01 activation boundary for future bounded parser/projection implementation work
  + [activation_boundary_id] is ir2-bounded-implementation-activation-boundary-v1
  + [activation_boundary_uuid] is 72a84b5b-07a4-4b83-bb1f-21475fa44270
  + [slice_id] is IR2-IA01
  + [boundary_status] is accepted_by_completion_review_pending
  + [model_route_used] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [implementation_scope] is activation boundary only

  = must: confirm future file inventory, fixture inventory, expected-ledger inventory, generated-output boundary, command plan, and proof gate for implementation slices
  = must: preserve accepted IR2 authority semantics without implementation code creation in this slice
  = must: keep IR3 implementation gated until IR2 implementation proof is accepted
  - never: create parser code, projection code, fixture source files, expected ledgers, generated outputs, dependencies, operations control, or live machine control in this slice

& [ConfirmedImplementationFileInventory] is the maximum code file inventory for IR2 parser/projection implementation
  + [future_code_file] is src/langsop/authority/discovery.py
  + [future_code_file] is src/langsop/authority/sop_parser.py
  + [future_code_file] is src/langsop/authority/extraction.py
