& [ConfirmedExpectedLedgerInventory] is the expected ledger inventory opened by IR2-IA02 after this boundary is accepted
  + [future_fixture_index] is docs/fixtures/IR2_Parser_Projection_Fixture_Index.v1.sop
  + [future_expected_ledger_file] is tests/fixtures/expected/ir2_parser_projection/kernel_records_expected.sop
  + [future_expected_ledger_file] is tests/fixtures/expected/ir2_parser_projection/validation_expected.sop
  + [future_expected_ledger_file] is tests/fixtures/expected/ir2_parser_projection/sqlite_projection_expected.sop

  = must: make expected ledgers reviewable without generated SQLite
  = must: distinguish expected KernelRecord candidates, validation outcomes, and SQLite projection rows
  = must: keep expected ledgers as tracked fixture authority only after IR2-IA02 completion review accepts them

& [ConfirmedGeneratedOutputBoundary] is the generated-output boundary for future tests and projection rebuilds
  + [generated_output_root] is .langsop/
  + [generated_output_root] is tests/fixtures/generated/ir2_parser_projection/
  + [ignored_generated_path] is .langsop/
  + [ignored_generated_path] is tests/fixtures/generated/
  + [generated_output_status] is projection_only
  + [source_authority_status] is docs/ and accepted tracked fixture source or expected ledgers only

  = must: refuse writes outside accepted generated roots during runtime or test execution
  = must: prove generated output deletion and rebuild cannot erase authority
  = must: reject generated SQLite, parser cache, generated index, generated report, or fixture output as source authority

& [ConfirmedDependencyBoundary] is the dependency boundary for the first IR2 implementation pass
  + [allowed_dependency_set] is Python standard library only
  + [allowed_stdlib] is dataclasses
  + [allowed_stdlib] is enum
  + [allowed_stdlib] is hashlib
  + [allowed_stdlib] is json
  + [allowed_stdlib] is pathlib
