  + [operations_control_authorized_after_IR2-IA01] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized_after_IR2-IA01] is false

  = must: open only IR2-IA02 after this boundary is accepted
  = must: keep parser and projection code gated until IR2-IA02 is reviewed and accepted

